{"ticker":"SYF","updated":"2026-10-24T00:14:49Z","profile":{"longName":"Synchrony Financial","shortName":"Synchrony Financial","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.synchrony.com","fullTimeEmployees":20000,"marketCap":23960309760,"trailingPE":7.6868477,"forwardPE":7.025484,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.4491782,"pegRatio":0.92,"targetMeanPrice":87.54167,"targetHighPrice":104.0,"targetLowPrice":73.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.047,"earningsGrowth":-0.063,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.46277002,"profitMargins":0.34069002,"totalRevenue":9783000064,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":88.77,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":63.08,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.81},"summary":"Synchrony Financial, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a consumer financial services company in the United States. The company provides credit products, such as credit cards, commercial credit products, and consumer installment loans. It also offers private label credit cards, dual and general purpose co-branded cards, short- and long-term installment loans, and consumer banking products; and deposit products, including certificates of deposit, individual retirement accounts, money market accounts, savings accounts, and sweep and affinity deposits, as well as accepts deposits through third-party firms. In addition, the company provides debt cancellation products to its credit card customers through online and mobile channels; and healthcare payments and financing solutions under the CareCredit and Walgreens brands; payments and financing solutions in the apparel, specialty retail, outdoor, music, and luxury industries, such as American Eagle, Dick's Sporting Goods, Guitar Center, Pandora, Polaris, Suzuki, and Sweetwater. It offers its credit products through programs established with a group of national and regional retailers, local merchants, manufacturers, buying groups, industry associations, and healthcare service providers; and deposit products through various channels, such as digital and print. It serves digital, health and wellness, retail, home, auto, telecom","summary_zh":"Synchrony Financial 及其子公司在美國以消費者金融服務公司營運。該公司提供信用卡、商業信貸產品和消費分期貸款等信貸產品。它還提供自有品牌信用卡、雙重用途和通用聯名卡、短期和長期分期貸款以及消費銀行產品；存款產品，包括存款證、個人退休帳戶、貨幣市場帳戶、儲蓄帳戶、掃款存款和親和存款，並透過第三方公司接受存款。此外，該公司還透過線上和行動管道向信用卡客戶提供債務取消產品； CareCredit 和 Walgreens 品牌下的醫療保健支付和融資解決方案；服裝、專業零售、戶外、音樂和奢侈品行業的支付和融資解決方案，例如 American Eagle、Dick's Sporting Goods、Guitar Center、Pandora、Polaris、Suzuki 和 Sweetwater。它透過與國家和地區零售商、當地商人、製造商、採購團體、行業協會和醫療保健服務提供者建立的計劃提供信貸產品；並透過各種管道（例如數位和印刷）存放產品。它服務於數位、健康與保健、零售、家庭、汽車、電信","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"信用服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":73.0,"h":74.19,"l":72.86,"c":74.0,"v":2960000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":73.8,"h":75.57,"l":73.59,"c":75.34,"v":4220900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":75.14,"h":76.152,"l":75.14,"c":75.76,"v":2967200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":76.04,"h":76.74,"l":75.865,"c":76.58,"v":2369500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":76.83,"h":77.15,"l":75.81,"c":76.34,"v":2404300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":74.98,"h":75.64,"l":73.86,"c":75.62,"v":3264900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":75.25,"h":75.998,"l":74.74,"c":75.49,"v":1966700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":75.9,"h":77.08,"l":75.5,"c":76.86,"v":2520800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":77.01,"h":77.41,"l":74.96,"c":75.61,"v":2149000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":75.78,"h":76.0,"l":74.53,"c":75.14,"v":2289400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":75.01,"h":76.28,"l":74.84,"c":76.07,"v":2150000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":76.0,"h":76.63,"l":73.9,"c":74.74,"v":5275400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":74.81,"h":76.225,"l":74.39,"c":76.01,"v":3165000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":75.89,"h":76.01,"l":75.25,"c":75.37,"v":1954400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":75.56,"h":77.06,"l":75.37,"c":76.28,"v":2661300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":76.07,"h":76.16,"l":73.71,"c":74.53,"v":4072700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":74.77,"h":76.6,"l":73.86,"c":74.82,"v":4332700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":75.48,"h":76.81,"l":75.085